# <PROJECT_NAME> — Learnings & Decision Records

> **What this is.** Durable knowledge distilled from building <PROJECT_NAME> with AI agents: the
> decisions that shape the product, the approaches that failed, the bug patterns that recur, and the
> working-method corrections the project owner has had to give more than once. A fresh agent with no
> transcript history should read this to avoid re-deriving (or re-committing) any of it.
>
> **What this is NOT.** Not architecture (→ `PROJECT.md`), not hard rules (→ `.github/instructions/*.instructions.md`,
> auto-loaded by `applyTo:` path match), not a changelog (→ `<CHANGELOG_PATH>`). Where a lesson is already a hard rule,
> this file carries one line + a pointer, never a copy.
>
> **Dating convention.** Every entry carries the date it was learned or decided. A dated fact is a
> claim about that date — re-verify before treating it as current. Current state lives in `PROJECT.md`.

